structural if on a subckt parameter, swept across the condition
ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
model vs vsource
model r resistor
v1 (in 0) vs dc=1
x1 (in out) sel area=1
subckt sel (a b)
  parameters area=1
  @if area < 2
    rsel (a b) r r=1k*area
  @else
    rsel (a b) r r=10k
  @end
  r2 (b 0) r r=1k
ends
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  sweep s1 instance="x1" parameter="area" values=[1, 1.5]
    analysis dc1 op
  sweep s2 instance="x1" parameter="area" values=[1, 3]
    analysis dc2 op
endc
